Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.41,0:00:05.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I was little,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:08.54,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I visited mountains in the countryside \Nwith my relatives for the first time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:12.57,Flashback,Younger Raion,0,0,0,,Oh man, camping is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:14.65,Flashback,Younger Kazuki,0,0,0,,Raion, wanna see some fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:16.45,Flashback,Younger Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.71,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad4\bord1.5\4c&H4E3866&\4a&H00&\3c&HA48D7C&}Century Fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.17,Flashback,Younger Raion,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.89,Flashback,Younger Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I forget to light it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:33.64,Flashback,Younger Kazuki,0,0,0,,Raion, are you sure you lit them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:37.37,Flashback,Younger Raion,0,0,0,,G-Gotcha! I never lit the fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:38.46,Flashback,Younger Kazuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:40.74,Flashback,Younger Raion,0,0,0,,Look at you, covering your ears like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:42.03,Flashback,Younger Kazuki,0,0,0,,Stop joking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:43.56,Flashback,Younger Kazuki,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll go light them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:44.65,Flashback,Younger Kazuki,0,0,0,,Wait right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.89,0:00:51.07,Flashback,Younger Kazuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.25,Flashback,Younger Raion,0,0,0,,Kazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:01.34,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raion!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:05.69,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,Hey, Raion! You listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.19,Flashback - Top,Kid A,0,0,0,,Hey! This is payback for Atsushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:11.01,Flashback - Top,Kid B,0,0,0,,Get real! This all happened because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:11.80,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,The local hoodlums have been \Nfighting a lot recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:15.31,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,You've been spreading lies to \Nput them up to it, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:21.06,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,You shouldn't get involved with me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:24.59,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,You know, I can tell you still \Nfeel guilty about the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.59,0:01:26.32,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,The one with the fireworks, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.79,0:01:28.61,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,Let it go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.53,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Kazuki, that's not it—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.45,Flashback - Top,Kazuki,0,0,0,,I was being too careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:33.70,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,The adults should've been\N keeping an eye on us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:36.73,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,That's that. I've told you this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:39.62,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Kazuki, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.17,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,For what it's worth, \NI like the lies you tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:45.38,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:49.24,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,Not that your recent lies \Nhave been totally innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:54.51,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,but the way I see it, you usually lie \Nfrom a place of goodwill and kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.99,0:01:58.51,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,Virtue won't get you \Nthrough everything in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.51,0:02:01.18,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,Sometimes, you need to \Nset a thief to catch a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:03.32,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,I like the idea of a hero \Nusing dirty tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:04.77,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:06.73,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,What I mean is, Raion...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:09.06,Flashback,Kazuki,0,0,0,,Don't ever change yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.80,0:02:15.30,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was able to be myself through it all \Nthanks to Kazuki's words...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:19.58,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\an4}Tasuketsu
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.26,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,We will now begin tallying the majority.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.42,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:45.48,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:00.89,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:04.62,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough of a reason \Nto join you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:11.56,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm no athlete by any means, but \NI'm confident that I've got decent brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:14.78,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sure, as you just demonstrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:16.90,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me join the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:20.24,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Very well, Raion Ouno!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:23.98,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I, Emperor Rahazelt, \Nshall welcome you into our gro—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.68,Default-Top,Raion,0,0,0,,Can we just cut the act already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:25.49,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:27.20,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm going to go check on Kunashiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:30.17,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Even though Souma and\N Nihonyanagi are with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:32.67,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,she took what happened pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:35.64,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Well sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:37.72,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,That definitely wasn't a pretty sight...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:40.74,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.80,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,do you have anyone else in your group \Nbesides the five of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.41,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.01,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,We have three others \Nwho are in the Tohoku region.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:51.03,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,And four others who are technically \Nsupposed to be missing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:52.47,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:55.95,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'll tell you since it's just \Nthe two of us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:59.53,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Our leader, Saneatsu, and his lieutenant, \NSaaya, are actually both dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:04.53,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,This is a secret between Team Saneatsu, \Nwho directly fought the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:10.41,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,The only ones who know besides me are Ryuta, \NOmi, and Rika, who went to Tohoku together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:11.64,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:14.92,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You needed to prevent a decline in morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:16.85,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,You catch on quick, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:18.05,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What about the other two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:19.72,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Judging from Eren's account,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:23.14,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Kazuhiko's probably dead, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:26.39,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,There's one person that's actually missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:28.41,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What's their name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:36.92,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Tojuro Yagihashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:40.74,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,We're not even sure what \Nhe was last doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:49.40,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Then he could very well still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:57.46,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Nishime here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:06:00.51,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,All clear here on the second \Nfloor's front desk. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:02.76,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Raion here. Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.26,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.25\frz12\pos(279,72)}All clear over here, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.81,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Looks like Gobo's good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:11.27,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The declaration of battle from the Queen...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:15.81,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,We'll ignore it this time and force them \Nto go on air one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:18.13,Flashback,Eren,0,0,0,,Force them? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:21.07,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,We'll air the Emperor's \Nmessage as usual tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:23.55,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I see. That way, the Queen will assume that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.55,0:06:27.17,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,we didn't tune in to her message \Nfrom this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:30.19,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Right, and they'll head back \Nto KHN a second time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:32.41,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,during the same window as \Nthe Emperor's usual announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:36.29,Flashback,Souma,0,0,0,,So we'll be there to \Nambush them when they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.71,Flashback,Eren,0,0,0,,Are you sure it'll be that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:42.23,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if they have \Nfull knowledge of our tactics...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.23,0:06:45.30,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,There's no doubt they've got \Nthe guns to back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:47.68,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\an2}Good evening, this is your Emperor. \NTime to announce today's results.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.39,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,As the current Emperor, Gobo will stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:53.31,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Eren and Shinozaki, you two stay \Nas his bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:55.10,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Nishime will take the front desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.78,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,and Souma and I will be in the \NMonitor Room to look over the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:07:02.51,Flashback,Raion,0,0,0,,Gobo, keep an eye on the security \Ncameras outside the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:06.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll need to watch for their combat strength.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:09.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}But with me on-site, we can edge \Nthem out with quicker decision-making.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:15.58,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,23:30 PM...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:19.29,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-13\fax0.05\an9\pos(566,119)}Look out.\NI see human shadows on outside cameras. {7:18}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:20.87,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:22.50,Italics,Nishime,0,0,0,,Raion, I hear footsteps!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:25.22,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Impossible! They're \Nat the front desk already?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Nishime! Get out of there! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:37.02,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that? What happened?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:42.89,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,You sure that wasn't a little overboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:44.53,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,All this rubble is annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.37,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,We've been dispatched for a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:47.78,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Why not make a scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:52.66,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,So... where do you think the current \NEmperor's subordinates are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.87,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,The Monitor Room, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:00.29,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shoot! They blocked the exit...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:02.21,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is there another way out?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:05.98,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}But... they're right there!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:07.51,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't have any time to waste!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:12.93,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right of Priority: Prioritize the \Nsound of rubble within this room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.64,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Idiot! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:15.78,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:17.10,Italics,Nishime,0,0,0,,Raion, Souma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:18.60,Italics,Nishime,0,0,0,,Get out safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:26.86,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prioritize physical safety!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:28.71,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Found ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:30.05,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or so you think!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.56,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:44.03,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Jeez, he's all hurt... \Nnot that I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:45.92,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,He's probably just stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:47.93,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is fine...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:50.46,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can buy time as long as\N their focus is on me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:53.18,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Run while you can... Souma! Raion!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:58.97,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can make my life mean something \Nfor even one second...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:05.23,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dying doesn't scare me one little bit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:06.79,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Not exactly the thrill I was hoping for,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:08.74,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,but I guess we gotta kill him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:13.28,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Gotta play it safe, in case there's others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:16.77,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, I work alone—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:19.03,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Kinda harsh to say right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:21.69,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,You guys! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:23.69,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hey, Nishime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:26.37,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Next time you try to off yourself \Nlike that, I'll beat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:30.37,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,You look like you're ready to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:31.88,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.90,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:37.97,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Materialization!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.27,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Auto Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:44.14,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Production Attribute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:45.56,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,This is trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Can you walk, Nishime?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.59,0:09:48.53,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Let's get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:51.57,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Souma can only materialize one more time...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:53.24,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}He doesn't have the stamina to fight!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:55.39,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:01.85,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a homing shield!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:05.71,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:16.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}What are chairs doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:19.56,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The fire hydrant!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.02,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Could that be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:24.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That guy's Prime Right is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:27.48,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:32.44,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,This is as far as you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:36.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like I thought... he controls water!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.18,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:40.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The water supply is still \Nfunctioning normally...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:44.67,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which makes... the entire city his weapon!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.55,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,You've got one shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:50.00,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,So we just have to outnumber you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.13,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Teleportation?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:57.59,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,You're dealing with two officers \Nworking under the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:10:59.20,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:06.60,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Wanna bet how many strikes it'll take?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:09.05,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Materialization!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.05,0:11:10.58,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Black Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:14.54,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,I'll take care of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:15.99,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,You two get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:18.39,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:20.38,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,You're at your limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.45,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,What else can you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.77,0:11:23.04,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Hey now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.91,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Take my stamina out of the equation \Nand he's no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:29.55,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Souma... don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.57,0:11:36.84,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,No... that's my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:40.80,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Raion! Don't say tha—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.77,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Excuse me, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:47.73,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:50.69,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}A Prime Right that switches places?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:55.71,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's how she got here \Nfrom the station in a split second...!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:57.99,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Attack! Bla—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.61,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:02.72,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Her power is to switch \Nplaces between objects!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:06.33,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,She'll use her powers if you attack\N and you'll hit one of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:10.79,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Fine then... As long as I leave her alone, \Nthat's one less thing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:13.41,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Ugh, figured you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.41,0:12:15.76,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,I hate being underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:20.33,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Right of Duplication!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.11,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Go on and kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:27.48,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Black Knight! Defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:36.90,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,There, now no one's standing in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:41.35,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Ikusa! Let's take down this entire block!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:44.87,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Nice. Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:47.19,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This entire block?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:50.41,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've been sandwiched!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:54.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}If this chick duplicates this guy's blow, \Nwe'll get attacked from both sides!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:56.68,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Water Utilization!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:12:59.61,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Here's a little bonus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:01.40,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Right of Adjustment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:02.48,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:09.48,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Right of Duplication!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:12.27,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.71,0:13:13.77,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Prime Right of—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:17.31,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,We'll be your shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:21.11,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the group to you, Souma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:24.72,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Right of Priority...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.99,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Prioritize Souma's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:30.42,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not a bad way to go out, right Kazuki?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:46.83,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:49.49,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Let's go home and report to Lady Kisaragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:55.81,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You scared me for a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.19,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Looks like you think you \Nfinished the job, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:03.74,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.21,0:14:12.35,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.80,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Ryuta! Omi! Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:19.00,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,You guys are back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:20.76,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:22.11,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:23.92,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,He's Shuji Nihonyanagi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:26.13,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,One of the volunteers \Nfrom our ambush operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:29.03,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:33.60,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}These guys... so they're \Nthe ones who were in Tohoku.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:37.06,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I've got a lot of questions, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:39.20,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We'll deal with them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:42.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:46.62,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The guy can control water with \Nhis Prime Right of Water Utilization
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:48.67,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,and he possesses the Adjustment Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:50.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The chick can switch places\N with her Prime Right
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:53.62,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,and her Duplication Right can copy objects!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:55.84,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Cool, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:58.25,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,All right gang, you know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.25,0:14:59.63,Default-Top,Rika,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.25,0:14:59.63,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.63,0:15:01.29,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Backup, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:03.13,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Then I'll kill you all together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:06.01,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Evasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:07.03,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Wha—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:12.42,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Ikusa, your control is all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.99,0:15:14.62,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Fine, I guess I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:15.89,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Hey, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:22.61,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Ya planning to come near me \Nor switch places with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:25.09,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,What a drag. Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:27.57,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did I say that?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:31.41,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:34.18,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Brat! What do you mean you "reject"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:38.22,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prime Right of Exchange...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:41.26,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not working?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:44.73,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's what Lady Kisaragi \Nwas talking about!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:47.88,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}The quasi-major Prime Right of Rejection!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:51.14,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,That should make our defenses perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:53.89,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,All right, Ryuta. Wanna finish things off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:55.02,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:57.90,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Spring formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:01.52,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Ryuta Ichinose, ready for liftoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:05.53,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prime Right of Fusion!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:15.95,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll separate them from Souma \Nand the guys with these pillars!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:17.87,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Ready for the finale?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:23.80,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Hey! Not bad, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.39,0:16:30.43,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Question time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:34.39,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Would you rather keep playing? Or get lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:35.60,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:40.26,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I was just a millisecond late...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:42.89,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Meguru! Let's retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:44.60,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:57.02,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Th-Thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:17:00.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They got rid of them like it was nothing...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:03.98,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is... what it means \Nto be a main-force unit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.71,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:10.84,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.03,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,You see, Raion...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:16.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You noticed we were in trouble \Non your device
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:19.89,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,and took a chance to send help \Nwith your Presentation Right. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:23.35,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,He spoils everything, for real...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:26.36,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We were lucky you three were nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:28.32,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,So, I've heard lots about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:30.86,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Raion Ouno, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:32.66,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I hear you're our newest member.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:34.32,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,That's right! For real!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:37.79,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm confident he can fill Narita's shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:39.62,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sane's?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:45.29,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,No way this little kid could \Ntake Sane's place, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:50.38,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Ryuta...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.58,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,He was my best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:58.56,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,and our one and only leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:02.56,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Are you good with sports and studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:03.84,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:05.17,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Just answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:08.48,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Well, no... I guess I'm not \Nthe athletic type...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.28,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,So you're only half as good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:16.31,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sane was good at both sports {\i1}and{\i0} studies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.31,0:18:18.93,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Only good at studying?! \NSo you've got no chops for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:20.33,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sorry bud, you lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.04,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Get real, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:25.79,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Sane? I don't even know who that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:27.00,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm me and no one else!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:30.29,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Are we being a bit jealous? \NDon't be lame, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.42,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.79,0:18:35.37,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:36.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:38.63,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I'd rather be friends with \Nsomeone with a few flaws
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:41.60,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,rather than the cool and collected type.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.59,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,After all, we're all here \Nto complement each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:50.64,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Immaturity can be a unique trait, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:54.53,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Well, I'm in 8th grade, \Nso I'm technically not mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:57.97,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:01.36,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You're in {\i1}8th grade{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:02.69,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'm in 8th grade too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.69,0:19:04.49,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking you, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:05.55,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What is {\i1}that{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:15.38,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The Emperor's tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.51,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,That's where we fought the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.27,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Fought the Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:26.40,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sane, Saaya, and the Emperor's bodies \Nare still at the top of the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:30.83,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The lower levels are covered in rubble, \Nso we can't get to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:35.12,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,We were talking about trying \Nto climb to the top when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.45,0:19:39.03,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,It's been a whole month, and \Nwith this hot summer weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:41.27,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,They've probably already decomposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:45.19,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We may be better off not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:49.37,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,But... I've gotta see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:54.11,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I have to face reality \Nand accept it to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:20:01.00,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm still not able to accept \Nthat Sane died...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:06.72,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's not right. He sacrificed \Nhis life to defeat the Emperor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.18,0:20:10.00,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now it's my turn to do the same \Nand defeat the Queen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:13.39,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}For that, I need to see it \Nwith my own eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.39,0:20:15.49,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}and accept that Sane's gone,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:19.25,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I can take on this next opponent!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:21.49,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have courage!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:23.80,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}Face the truth!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:29.46,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodbye... Sane...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:42.50,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,W-What's wrong, Ryuta-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:44.97,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,They haven't decomposed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:48.89,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sane and Saaya, they're still \Nthe same as that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:50.29,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.39,0:20:54.54,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You're right... it's like they're asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:56.61,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,But that's... how's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:04.23,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:08.63,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The Emperor's body is... gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:12.00,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Then that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.45,0:21:15.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The Emperor's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:19.84,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,Shock
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.11,0:21:18.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,...still alive?!
